        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, production mix UCTE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, production mix UCTE
Electricity net production shares are based on an annual average for the year 2008 according to IEA Electricity Information.;
UUID: 69d96275-7566-3a4d-a6a1-04d4faeede99
It includes shares of national electricity production UCTE member countries (in 2008) at the busbar. It does not include transformation, transport nor distribution losses.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current (2004) average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: GWh
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_69d96275-7566-3a4d-a6a1-04d4faeede99.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
